    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d665">

                <pb facs="0949" n="821" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg821"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.79620 Boeing Airplane Co./9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bliss</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-02-09T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 9,
                                1928—6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received February 9—3:55
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>10. Your telegram No. 6, February 6, 6 p.m.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d665-f1"/> Does
                    Captain O’Neill intend to demonstrate before Argentine Army and Navy air
                    service? What information have you as to approximate date of his arrival in
                    Argentina and does he intend to arrive by air or by ship?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bliss</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
